  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="On the Download Monthly Report page: enters the Tax ID and year, then downloads each month's report.&#xA;Each download is captured from the browser's Downloads folder (Wait for Download) and moved to in_ReportDirPath as &lt;TaxID&gt;-&lt;Year&gt;-&lt;MM&gt;.csv.&#xA;A missing month shows the ACME alert 'No report found...': logged at Info and skipped.&#xA;Leftover files for the Tax ID are deleted first so a retry never merges stale data.&#xA;No report at all for the year -&gt; BusinessRuleException. Anything else -&gt; System Exception." DisplayName="System1 Download Monthly Reports" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
